<p>Throw a small, unstable steam engine on the battlefield that will go critical after 2 turns.</p><p>It will then create an explosion of hot vapour in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 3,</acronym> burning all foes for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">184, 248, 298, 340, 377</acronym> fire damage.</p><p>Any bleeding foe caught in the flames will take 40% more damage.</p><p>Damage scales with your Steampower.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Tick Tock Tick BOOM!</span></span></p>